    <dcterms:identifier>dimensionsOther</dcterms:identifier>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Any other measurements that are notable on this garment, in inches, as decimals to the nearest quarter inch. Describe what the measurement is of, in parentheses, after the measurement.</rdfs:comment>
