    <dcterms:description rdf:nodeID="Nb25a3c9df2644bca8d804bed8cf8f188"/>
    <dcterms:description xml:lang="en">Fine, lustrous, soft, sheer cloth originating in the Philippines, woven from piÃ±a fibers, from the pineapple plant. It is used for decorative handkerchiefs, trimmings, lingerie, accessories, and home furnishings.</dcterms:description>
