  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/costumeCore/ontology/CC00231">
    <dcterms:identifier>CC00231</dcterms:identifier>
    <dcterms:description xml:lang="en">Textile in which warp/weft pathways are over/under every other thread. Tabby weave textiles are woven by a method based on a unit of two ends and two picks, in which each end passes over one and under one pick; the binding points are set over one end on successive picks.</dcterms:description>
