    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Woven fabrics with ribbed or corded effects in either the warp or filling direction. Warp faced rib weave has a fine warp covering a thicker weft. In weft faced rib weave, a thin weft completely covers a thicker warp.</rdfs:label>
