  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/costumeCore/ontology/CC00249">
    <dcterms:description xml:lang="en">The principal tissue of trees and other plants that provides both strength and a means of conducting nutrients. Wood is one of the most versatile materials known.</dcterms:description>
