    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">The effect of graduated or shaded color in textiles, created through the weave or by dyeing. The effect may be monochromatic or polychromatic. The term is most often used for textiles, but may also be extended to painted or colored surfaces that display a graduated shading effect.</rdfs:label>
